From a4a8e65fd74e4332d1c56634ada049cc3a327448 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Omacast package build <packaging@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:04:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add 1080p profiles with 16:10 letterbox

Accept 1920x1080 at 60 and 30 fps beside the Safe 720p launch, fall back
to 1080p30 when a sink advertises that mode and refuses 60, and pad a
non-16:9 panel to a true 1920x1080 frame.
